  "title": "Noun endings: plural",
  "description": "Plural endings in every case, including nouns for groups of men.",
  "sections": [
    {
      "text": "In the plural, the dative (-om), instrumental (-ami) and locative (-ach) endings are the same for almost every noun. Nouns for men have special nominative forms (studenci, Polacy), and their accusative is the same as the genitive.",
